    btn_pay_load:"Reread the ledger",
    nt_pay:"Reads the transactions of the renting account from the Xahau ledger automatically and totals the rent-related ones (rent, extensions, refunds, fees) by month. EVR is what you paid to rent and extend the mailbox (refunds subtracted); XAH is the fee of each transaction.\nFor conversion, a year of daily prices for EVR and XAH (at 00:00 UTC) is fetched from CoinGecko at once, in the currency you chose. CoinGecko receives only this device's IP address, the time of the request and the currency (no account and no dates).\nPrices are fetched only when you press [Get prices] the first time; after that, once a day at a varying time. No prices are fetched for 6 hours after this account's transactions or after entering an account (so the times are harder to link to this device). Prices older than a year are not available, so those transactions are not converted.",
